 l a 2\,500 submission cap is reached.\n\nDeadlines\nSymposium and sessio
 n proposals (extended): 2026-01-26\nAbstract submission opens: 2026-05-2
 7\nAbstract submission (extended): 2026-06-11\nAdvance member registrati
 on opens: 2026-07-15\nLate breaking abstract submission opens: 2026-09-0
 8\nDeadline to switch from virtual only to in person presentation: 2026-
 09-10\nLate breaking abstract submission: 2026-09-15\nRegistration cance
 llation for refund: 2026-10-05\nHousing reservations close: 2026-11-03\n
 \nhttps://www.sfn.org/meetings/neuroscience-2026
LOCATION:Washington\, District of Columbia\, Walter E. Washington Convent
 ion Center
